# Agentic Kit discoverability sync

Canonical sources:

- `src/data/docs.ts` — docs copy
- `src/data/site.ts` — site meta and crawl policy

Generated (do **not** hand-edit):

- `public/llms.txt`, `public/llms-full.txt`, `public/llms/docs/*.txt`
- `public/robots.txt`, `public/sitemap.xml`, `public/ai.txt`, `public/route-lastmod.json`
- `public/.well-known/ai`, `public/.well-known/api-catalog`, `public/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json`

After editing canonical data:

```bash
pnpm generate:llms
pnpm generate:discoverability
```

`pnpm build` runs both via `prebuild`. Verify with `pnpm check:sync`.
